# Tier 3 (lead only, see .github/CODEOWNERS). New in this pull request: the repository had no root .gitattributes.
# The check tools and their fixtures compare bytes and run under bash, so they are checked out with LF on every platform
# (a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise break two tests).
rl/tools/** text eol=lf
# The workflow and CODEOWNERS are read by tests that split on LF and by bash: LF on every platform.
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
.github/CODEOWNERS text eol=lf
